Design a modern SaaS web application and mobile app interface for a smart waste management platform called CleanCircle.

The product is a subscription-based door-to-door waste collection platform that helps households track and reduce waste while paying based on bucket size.

The system includes three interfaces:

Household customer web/mobile app

Waste collection agent mobile app

Admin operations dashboard

The design should follow modern SaaS design patterns similar to Stripe, Uber, and Notion dashboards.

Use a clean sustainability theme with colors such as green, white, and soft grey.

Product Overview

CleanCircle enables households to:

• subscribe to waste collection
• choose bucket sizes (10L, 25L, 50L)
• maintain a prepaid wallet
• track waste generation
• earn rewards for reducing waste

Waste collectors confirm pickups using a mobile app, and the platform tracks waste analytics.

Core UX Principles

Design should emphasize:

• simplicity
• transparency
• environmental awareness
• gamification
• operational efficiency

The UI should feel friendly, trustworthy, and sustainability-focused.

Interface 1 — Household Customer App

Design screens for the following user journey.

1. Onboarding / Signup

Include:

• Google login
• Mobile OTP verification
• Address selection using map
• Household details (family size)

Goal: frictionless onboarding.

2. Plan Selection Screen

Allow user to choose bucket size:

10L — small households
25L — medium households
50L — large households

Display:

• price per month
• pickups included
• environmental impact message

Show this as interactive subscription cards.

3. Wallet Dashboard

Display:

• wallet balance
• recharge button
• transaction history
• auto recharge option

Design like a fintech wallet interface.

4. Waste Tracking Dashboard

Show analytics such as:

• monthly waste volume
• pickup history
• waste reduction trend
• environmental score

Use:

• charts
• progress bars
• sustainability badges

Gamify the experience.

5. Pickup History

List of:

• date
• bucket size
• collector confirmation
• GPS verification

Allow users to report missed pickups.

6. Rewards & Eco Score

Display:

• reward points
• cashback earned
• waste reduction achievements
• eco badges

Include leaderboard concept for societies.

Interface 2 — Waste Collector Agent App

Design a simple mobile-first interface optimized for field workers.

Agent Home Screen

Display:

• today's route
• number of pickups remaining
• quick start button

Household Pickup Screen

Show:

• household name
• address
• QR scan button
• confirm pickup button
• mark missed pickup option

Include large touch buttons for fast usage.

Route View

Map interface showing:

• next pickup
• optimized route
• completed pickups

Daily Performance

Show:

• pickups completed
• missed pickups
• route efficiency

Interface 3 — Admin Dashboard

Design a powerful SaaS operations dashboard.

Admin Overview

Display metrics:

• total households
• pickups today
• active agents
• monthly revenue
• waste collected

Use modern data visualization cards.

Household Management

Admin can:

• view households
• change plans
• manage wallet balances
• view pickup history

Agent Management

Features:

• add agents
• assign routes
• monitor performance

Include route assignment UI.

Waste Analytics

Charts showing:

• waste by area
• waste by bucket size
• reduction trends
• recycling rates

